# # 2. — No AI / ML Training

2.1. — You STRICTLY must NOT include, incorporate, integrate, upload or
otherwise use the Work (or any Derivatives) in (the making or formation of) any
dataset, model or process for training, improving, diagnosing, fine-tuning,
